	"data": "ThoughtBubbles: Godot Migration\n\nWhat It Is\nThe migration of ThoughtBubbles from Unity to Godot Engine, which occurred during Oct–Nov 2025. This is a major architectural decision that shapes all future TB development.\n\nWhy Godot Won (Oct 2025 Analysis)\n\n| Factor | Verdict |\n|--------|---------|\n| XR/Quest support | Godot has strong OpenXR + Quest community plugins |\n| Editor tooling | Godot has mature visual editor; Bevy does not |\n| Language mix | Godot allows GDScript + Rust (GDExtension) for…",
